troke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"></path></svg><span data-bl-t=\"heading\">Tyler</span></h1><p class=\"cv-hero__status\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">We are getting married</span><!-- --><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">.</span></p></div><p class=\"cv-hero__tag\" data-bl-s=\"\" data-bl-b=\"\"><time datetime=\"2027-07-17\" class=\"cv-hero__date\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Saturday, July 17, 2027</span></time><span class=\"cv-hero__motif\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">07 · 17 · 27</span></span><span class=\"cv-hero__place\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Chicago Athletic Association Hotel</span><!-- --><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">, </span><!-- --><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Chicago</span></span></p><div class=\"cv-hero__rest\"><p class=\"cv-hero__lede\"><span><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">We are inviting the people we love into the places, adventures, and memories that made us. Details as they are settled.</span></span></p><p class=\"cv-sky\" data-bl-s=\"\"><span class=\"cv-sky__num\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">297</span></span><span class=\"cv-sky__unit\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">days</span><!-- --> <!-- --><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">to go</span></span></p><div class=\"cv-hero__actions\"><a class=\"cv-btn cv-btn--primary\" href=\"/our-story\" data-bl-s=\"\" data-bl-dark=\"\" data-bl-b=\"\"><span><span data-bl-t=\"label\">Our Story</span></span></a><a class=\"cv-btn cv-btn--ghost\" href=\"/explore-caa\" data-bl-s=\"\" data-bl-b=\"\"><span><span data-bl-t=\"label\">Explore the building</span></span></a></div><p class=\"cv-hero__note\"><span><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Many of you will be travelling in: rooms, airports, and getting around will appear here as we confirm them.</span></span></p></div></section><section id=\"adventures\" class=\"cv-section cv-section--default\" aria-labelledby=\"adventures-title\" data-bl-k=\"section\" data-bl-label=\"Our adventures\"><hr class=\"cv-fern\" data-bl-s=\"\"><div class=\"cv-section__grid\"><div class=\"cv-section__text\"><div class=\"cv-section__head\"><h2 id